      "side": 1,
      "message": "I could not find a comment that mentions this, so I sincerely apologize if I am duplicating someone\u0027s comment. But from what I can tell and from testing locally, the CL is missing the modification of `jump_to_payload` implemenetation and at the moment pvmfw with this change clears the reserved memory blobs before jumping to the payload.",
      "revId": "e169071f74d4365bb66b5b8b56de5a51fb46f11a",
