      "writtenOn": "2025-03-21T00:52:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay, I see now. Would the be any issue with having `next_dice_handover` always be next to all the other reserved memory? If not, then I could just allocate all the pages needed in a continguous chunk and that minimizes the changes need in `jump_to_payload`.",
      "parentUuid": "a8ea0567_d8ee1789",
      "revId": "e169071f74d4365bb66b5b8b56de5a51fb46f11a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
